        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes an Oushak rug special?",
            "answer": "<p>Oushak rugs are among the most celebrated traditional rugs in the world, known for their <strong>soft color palettes, large-scale motifs, and refined elegance</strong>. Originating from centuries-old weaving traditions, they are valued for their ability to bring warmth, sophistication, and timeless character to a space.</p><p>At Bisha Rugs, each Oushak is <strong>handwoven by skilled artisans</strong>, ensuring every piece carries its own individuality and craftsmanship.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why invest in a handmade Oushak rug?",
            "answer": "<p>Unlike mass-produced rugs, a handwoven Oushak is crafted slowly and intentionally. The result is a piece that brings warmth, artistry, and lasting value to your home.</p><p>It is not simply a decorative object — it is a piece of living craftsmanship designed to be enjoyed for generations.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Bisha Oushak rugs handmade?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every Bisha rug is <strong>completely handwoven on a traditional loom</strong>.</p><p>Each knot is tied individually by artisans who have inherited their craft through generations. Because of this process, no two rugs are ever exactly the same.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_9cje4Y": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials are used in your rugs?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Oushak rugs are made using <strong>premium natural wool</strong>, selected for its durability, softness, and ability to hold color beautifully over time.</p><p>Natural fibers allow the rug to age gracefully while maintaining its structure and comfort underfoot.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_8XRiXE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my rug look exactly like the photos?",
            "answer": "<p>Our photos represent the rug as accurately as possible. However, because each rug is handmade and natural fibers interact uniquely with dyes and lighting, <strong>slight variations in tone, texture, and pattern may occur</strong>.</p><p>These subtle differences are part of the charm and authenticity of handcrafted rugs.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_fYAYhi": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are size variations normal for handmade rugs?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Because Oushak rugs are woven by hand, <strong>small variations in size (typically within 3–5%) </strong>may occur. This is a natural result of traditional weaving techniques and is considered a hallmark of authentic craftsmanship.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_pNbxze": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to receive my rug?",
            "answer": "<p>For <strong>in-stock rugs</strong>, orders are typically processed within <strong>2–5 business days</strong> before shipping.<br/></p><p>For <strong>custom or made-to-order rugs</strong>, weaving timelines vary (normally 4 to 6 weeks) depending on size and complexity. We provide an estimated timeline before production begins.<br/></p><p>Once shipped, delivery within the United States typically takes <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_zpD7ew": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer custom Oushak rugs?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We offer <strong>custom sizes and design adjustments</strong> for clients seeking a rug tailored to their space.</p><p>Because custom rugs are woven specifically for you, they require a production period and are <strong>final sale once weaving begins</strong>.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_XfGjFX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we ship worldwide.</p><p>International orders may be subject to <strong>customs duties, taxes, or import fees</strong> determined by your country’s regulations. These charges are the responsibility of the customer unless otherwise stated.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_7hec4Q": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if my rug arrives damaged?",
            "answer": "<p>In the rare event that a rug arrives damaged during transit, please contact us within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> and provide photographs of the rug and packaging.</p><p>We will work quickly to resolve the issue with a replacement or appropriate solution.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_A7xkqk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return my rug?",
            "answer": "<p>Returns are accepted for <strong>standard (non-custom) rugs</strong> within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>, provided the rug is unused and returned in original condition.</p><p>Custom or made-to-order rugs are not eligible for return.<br/></p><p>Please contact us before sending any item back so we can guide you through the return process.<br/>Note: Our business model are made to order and custom rugs.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_e6yErT": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I care for my Oushak rug?",
            "answer": "<p>To maintain the beauty of your rug:</p><p></p><ul><li>Vacuum gently without a rotating brush<br/></li><li>Rotate the rug periodically for even wear<br/></li><li>Blot spills immediately with a clean cloth<br/></li><li>Professional rug cleaning is recommended for deep cleaning<br/></li></ul><p>With proper care, a handwoven Oushak can last for decades.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "question_WUQBXw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I contact Bisha Rugs?",
            "answer": "<p>We are always happy to assist with questions about sizing, design, or custom orders.</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> Love@bisharugs.com</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> https://bisharugs.com</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
